              "instruction": "samiʿnā usṭūra ʿan jabal qadīm. — We heard a legend about an old mountain.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *samiʿnā usṭūra ʿan jabal qadīm.* — We heard a legend about an old mountain.]"
