              "text": "تخيل — takhayyala — \"to imagine\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تخيلت البنت أنها تطير فوق المدينة. takhayyalat al-bint annahā taṭīru fawqa al-madīna. The girl imagined that she was flying over the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يتخيل, yatakhayyal."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It often takes أن: تخيلت أنها …, she imagined that she …."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تخيل (takhayyala) is built on the native Arabic root kh-y-l (Lane), \"to think, to fancy\", the root of khayāl, imagination. It is Form V, \"to picture to oneself\"."
            }
          ]
        },
